408
00:14:55,190 --> 00:14:56,240
It's a big day today.

409
00:14:56,240 --> 00:14:56,870
I'll talk to you about it another day.

410
00:14:56,870 --> 00:14:57,400
No, wait.

411
00:14:58,260 --> 00:14:59,090
On that case,

412
00:14:59,170 --> 00:15:00,200
she was the only one

413
00:15:00,200 --> 00:15:01,080
