444
00:15:47,150 --> 00:15:47,790
Dashijia Village.

445
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:48,840
Buy a ticket tomorrow
and arrive the day after.

446
00:15:48,840 --> 00:15:49,370
Go ahead.

447
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:55,150
Don't be mad at me. Let's go.

448
00:15:55,150 --> 00:15:55,840
Let's go.

449
00:15:58,870 --> 00:15:59,670
Fine, I'll go.

450
00:16:00,870 --> 00:16:01,550
I'll go.

451
00:16:04,670 --> 00:16:05,750
