465
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:29,000
Thank you.

466
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,030
Thank you, Mrs. Qin.

467
00:16:30,030 --> 00:16:30,910
You look stunning.

468
00:16:30,910 --> 00:16:31,910
Court Pres. Ding.

469
00:16:31,960 --> 00:16:32,550
Congratulations.

470
00:16:32,550 --> 00:16:33,410
Congratulations to you.

471
00:16:33,410 --> 00:16:34,810
Congratulations to you.

472
00:16:35,030 --> 00:16:35,600
Congratulations.

473
00:16:35,600 --> 00:16:36,360
Thank you.

474
00:16:36,360 --> 00:16:37,600
Court Pres. Ding, congratulations.

475
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,600
Court Pres. Ding.

476
00:16:39,380 --> 00:16:39,840
Zhigao.

477
00:16:40,720 --> 00:16:41,960
