483
00:16:47,440 --> 00:16:48,500
Please don't mind.

484
00:16:48,750 --> 00:16:49,550
Of course not.

485
00:16:49,650 --> 00:16:50,620
We know you

486
00:16:50,750 --> 00:16:52,240
