487
00:16:52,240 --> 00:16:53,200
We understand.

488
00:16:54,270 --> 00:16:54,910
Court Pres. Ding.

489
00:16:54,910 --> 00:16:55,360
No.

490
00:16:55,360 --> 00:16:56,960
