501
00:17:12,510 --> 00:17:13,310
That's great to see.

502
00:17:13,310 --> 00:17:13,920
Court Pres. Ding,

503
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:14,650
we came today

504
00:17:14,720 --> 00:17:16,380
