548
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,270
She's back now.

549
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,480
Just got back.

550
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:28,660
Then why

551
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:30,360
