552
00:18:30,510 --> 00:18:31,510
She got divorced,

553
00:18:32,680 --> 00:18:34,880
but she still holds a grudge against us.

554
00:18:35,110 --> 00:18:36,240
She won't come home.

555
00:18:36,830 --> 00:18:38,160
She's staying in Nanlu,

556
00:18:38,510 --> 00:18:40,200
