557
00:18:40,350 --> 00:18:42,480
She hasn't made any money these years.

558
00:18:44,550 --> 00:18:46,790
Life has been really tough
for her out there.

559
00:18:46,790 --> 00:18:48,200
You two

560
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,700
