562
00:18:50,880 --> 00:18:52,440
So you can all look out for each other.

563
00:18:52,440 --> 00:18:52,840
Right?

564
00:18:54,070 --> 00:18:55,880
That's exactly what we mean.

565
00:18:56,590 --> 00:18:57,590
Court Pres. Ding,

566
00:18:57,700 --> 00:18:58,370
I knew

567
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,930
you would help our Xiaowen.

568
00:19:00,350 --> 00:19:01,510
I knew you would arrange

569
00:19:01,510 --> 00:19:02,790
