570
00:19:02,790 --> 00:19:03,830
Thank you, Court Pres. Ding.

571
00:19:03,830 --> 00:19:04,270
No, wait.

572
00:19:04,270 --> 00:19:05,510
-Thank you.
-Court Pres. Ding.

573
00:19:05,510 --> 00:19:06,680
Any work will do,

574
00:19:06,790 --> 00:19:07,550
