575
00:19:07,550 --> 00:19:08,070
Right.

576
00:19:08,200 --> 00:19:09,730
You've watched her grow up.

577
00:19:09,750 --> 00:19:10,510
-Yes, yes.
-Wait.

578
00:19:10,510 --> 00:19:11,720
She just hates him.

579
00:19:11,790 --> 00:19:12,120
Wait.

580
00:19:12,160 --> 00:19:13,830
And now she hates me too because of him.

581
00:19:13,830 --> 00:19:15,240
That was his bad idea.

582
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:16,720
Listen to me!

583
00:19:17,480 --> 00:19:18,610
Will you let me talk?

584
00:19:18,640 --> 00:19:19,680
Please, go ahead.

585
00:19:20,030 --> 00:19:20,760
Are you done?

586
00:19:22,550 --> 00:19:23,350
Listen to me.

587
00:19:24,350 --> 00:19:26,640
Hiring people requires a process.

588
00:19:27,170 --> 00:19:28,320
I, alone,

589
00:19:28,350 --> 00:19:29,750
can't make the decision.

590
00:19:29,920 --> 00:19:30,980
Do you understand?

591
00:19:31,000 --> 00:19:31,270
Yes.

592
00:19:32,200 --> 00:19:33,060
We understand.

593
00:19:35,510 --> 00:19:36,510
Court Pres. Ding,

594
00:19:37,160 --> 00:19:39,030
we all know it's hard
to get things done now.

595
00:19:39,030 --> 00:19:40,000
I understand this.

596
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:41,200
Well, you... you...

597
00:19:41,400 --> 00:19:42,830
W-What are you doing?

598
00:19:43,200 --> 00:19:43,590
No.

599
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:44,640
She doesn't know any better.

600
00:19:44,640 --> 00:19:44,920
Please don't take it to heart.

601
00:19:44,920 --> 00:19:46,640
Gift money, gift money.

602
00:19:46,830 --> 00:19:48,400
Court Pres. Ding, it's clean money.

603
00:19:48,400 --> 00:19:49,960
It's all the money I earned
from selling peanuts.

604
00:19:49,960 --> 00:19:50,720
I believe the money

605
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:51,850
is honestly earned.

606
00:19:52,070 --> 00:19:53,730
I only have this one daughter.

607
00:19:54,030 --> 00:19:55,430
Please, have some mercy.

608
00:19:55,550 --> 00:19:56,110
Let my daughter

609
00:19:56,110 --> 00:19:57,000
have a peaceful

610
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:57,890
wedding today.

611
00:19:57,920 --> 00:19:59,320
That's all I ask. Please.

612
00:19:59,400 --> 00:20:00,510
I'm begging you.

613
00:20:00,510 --> 00:20:01,720
Please, Court Pres. Ding.

614
00:20:01,720 --> 00:20:02,510
Help Xiaowen.

615
00:20:02,510 --> 00:20:04,080
I'm begging you, please.

616
00:20:04,110 --> 00:20:05,400
Court Pres. Ding, I'll kneel down for you.

617
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,200
Pull your wife up.

618
00:20:06,200 --> 00:20:07,200
Help your wife up.

619
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:07,680
What are you doing?

620
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,010
You are really a psycho!

621
00:20:09,400 --> 00:20:09,880
Get up.

622
00:20:09,960 --> 00:20:10,480
I beg you.

623
00:20:10,480 --> 00:20:11,200
Get up, now!

624
00:20:12,310 --> 00:20:12,750
Court Pres. Ding.

625
00:20:12,750 --> 00:20:13,750
Get up! Stand up!

626
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:15,790
Gao Qiuyue, are you crazy?

627
00:20:15,830 --> 00:20:16,630
Don't stop me!

628
00:20:16,680 --> 00:20:17,680
Court Pres. Ding.

629
00:20:17,720 --> 00:20:18,310
Court Pres. Ding, I'm begging you!

630
00:20:18,310 --> 00:20:19,070
Stop it!

631
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:20,070
Court Pres. Ding!

632
00:20:24,270 --> 00:20:25,030
Stop making a scene!

633
00:20:25,030 --> 00:20:26,920
You've ruined everything!

634
00:20:27,360 --> 00:20:28,990
You coward!

635
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:42,440
Oh, no.

636
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:17,760
Let's go home.

637
00:21:44,840 --> 00:21:48,430
[1996, Nanlu City]

638
00:21:49,160 --> 00:21:50,160
Check please!

639
00:21:50,510 --> 00:21:50,970
Coming.

640
00:21:56,790 --> 00:21:57,240
Kiddo,

641
00:21:58,030 --> 00:21:58,890
remember this:

642
00:21:59,070 --> 00:22:00,480
If they give us attitude,

643
00:22:02,070 --> 00:22:03,800
we just pretend we don't see it.

644
00:22:04,480 --> 00:22:05,540
This case of yours,

645
00:22:06,000 --> 00:22:07,930
the first trial sent it back twice.

646
00:22:08,310 --> 00:22:09,890
Then there were two more appeals.

647
00:22:09,890 --> 00:22:10,480
Who knows how many

648
00:22:10,480 --> 00:22:12,140
people have handled it by now.

649
00:22:12,400 --> 00:22:13,510
If it's a wrongful conviction,

650
00:22:13,510 --> 00:22:15,720
all these people will be held accountable
in the future.

651
00:22:15,720 --> 00:22:17,720
Think about the pushback we'll get.

652
00:22:18,240 --> 00:22:19,350
But the longer it drags on,

653
00:22:19,350 --> 00:22:21,410
the worse the liability gets, right?

654
00:22:22,550 --> 00:22:23,680
That's true enough.

655
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:26,270
Mentor, do you mean

656
00:22:26,480 --> 00:22:28,000
they know it's a wrongful conviction,

657
00:22:28,000 --> 00:22:29,240
but to protect themselves,

658
00:22:29,240 --> 00:22:30,370
they won't admit it?

659
00:22:31,030 --> 00:22:32,510
Just from the case file,

660
00:22:32,920 --> 00:22:34,750
we found so many problems.

661
00:22:35,930 --> 00:22:36,830
This case went through two trials,

662
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:38,030
passed through so many hands,

663
00:22:38,030 --> 00:22:40,000
and not one person noticed?

664
00:22:40,920 --> 00:22:41,920
Is that possible?

665
00:22:42,720 --> 00:22:43,450
Impossible.

666
00:22:44,240 --> 00:22:45,440
I don't understand either.

667
00:22:45,440 --> 00:22:46,170
If it were me,

668
00:22:46,350 --> 00:22:47,310
if I found a problem with a case,

669
00:22:47,310 --> 00:22:49,770
I would definitely
bring it up immediately.

670
00:22:51,350 --> 00:22:52,510
But not necessarily.

671
00:22:52,510 --> 00:22:53,710
Five or six years ago,

672
00:22:54,440 --> 00:22:55,370
I wouldn't have.

673
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,200
Look at you.

674
00:22:58,680 --> 00:22:59,350
Prison

675
00:22:59,750 --> 00:23:01,210
can really reform people.

676
00:23:01,680 --> 00:23:03,000
It's you who reforms people, Mentor.

677
00:23:03,270 --> 00:23:03,720
Me?

678
00:23:04,640 --> 00:23:05,750
A case

679
00:23:06,270 --> 00:23:07,510
passes through countless hands,

680
00:23:07,510 --> 00:23:08,370
and invisibly,

681
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:10,680
the responsibility gets diluted.

682
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:13,000
Everyone thinks:

683
00:23:14,030 --> 00:23:15,160
I'm only responsible

684
00:23:15,160 --> 00:23:16,560
for my little piece of it.

685
00:23:17,720 --> 00:23:18,400
Or,

686
00:23:18,880 --> 00:23:20,940
I'm only responsible to my superior.

687
00:23:21,400 --> 00:23:22,270
As for what the case

688
00:23:22,270 --> 00:23:23,200
is really about,

689
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:25,530
that's not for me to decide.

690
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:27,750
So now,

691
00:23:28,310 --> 00:23:29,310
how do we fix this?

692
00:23:29,890 --> 00:23:31,200
Haven't they been talking about

693
00:23:31,200 --> 00:23:32,200
judicial reform?

694
00:23:33,480 --> 00:23:35,350
This is exactly what needs to change.

695
00:23:35,350 --> 00:23:36,880
We need to fix it at the root.

696
00:23:39,240 --> 00:23:40,400
How's the food, you two?

697
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,460
Great, it's great.

698
00:23:41,720 --> 00:23:42,030
Sir.

699
00:23:42,310 --> 00:23:43,510
My classmates and I

700
00:23:43,680 --> 00:23:44,920
used to come to Nanlu a lot.

701
00:23:44,920 --> 00:23:46,110
The first thing we did
after getting off the bus

702
00:23:46,110 --> 00:23:47,240
was to come here for noodles.

703
00:23:47,240 --> 00:23:48,900
You always gave us extra meat.

704
00:23:49,070 --> 00:23:49,820
I'm sorry.

705
00:23:49,960 --> 00:23:51,270
I'll get you some more meat right away.

706
00:23:51,270 --> 00:23:53,200
Welcome back to Nanlu, old friend.

707
00:23:53,210 --> 00:23:53,690
No, Sir.

708
00:23:53,720 --> 00:23:55,050
That's not what I meant.

709
00:24:05,480 --> 00:24:06,310
Don't be afraid.

710
00:24:06,310 --> 00:24:07,310
He's a gentle lunatic.

711
00:24:07,310 --> 00:24:08,160
He doesn't hurt people.

712
00:24:08,160 --> 00:24:09,400
Don't move!

713
00:24:09,590 --> 00:24:11,110
Ropes. I'm afraid of ropes.

714
00:24:11,110 --> 00:24:11,770
Don't move!

715
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:13,330
Afraid of ropes.

716
00:24:13,350 --> 00:24:14,640
Hit, hit, hit!

717
00:24:14,750 --> 00:24:16,880
Your grandma will bring you food tonight.

718
00:24:16,880 --> 00:24:18,310
So you just keep him chained up like this?

719
00:24:18,310 --> 00:24:19,510
Just poop right here.

720
00:24:20,200 --> 00:24:21,660
What? Should I cuddle him?

721
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:24,210
It's resolved.

722
00:24:24,350 --> 00:24:25,750
Is that how it's resolved?

723
00:24:25,750 --> 00:24:27,480
He's a human, not an animal!

724
00:24:28,030 --> 00:24:29,510
You're from the big city.
You don't understand.

725
00:24:29,510 --> 00:24:30,160
Go, go, go.

726
00:24:30,400 --> 00:24:32,070
Hurry, hurry, hurry. Go.

727
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:35,510
This is how it is in the countryside.

728
00:24:36,110 --> 00:24:37,710
There's only so much I can do.

729
00:24:38,790 --> 00:24:39,510
Excuse me.

730
00:24:43,960 --> 00:24:45,350
No!

731
00:24:59,480 --> 00:25:05,370
[Nanlu City People's Procuratorate]

732
00:25:05,510 --> 00:25:07,240
We have received the materials

733
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:09,200
and studied them.

734
00:25:09,730 --> 00:25:11,110
This case caused quite a stir

735
00:25:11,110 --> 00:25:12,170
in Nanlu back then.

736
00:25:12,270 --> 00:25:14,310
After all, the criminal's methods

737
00:25:14,350 --> 00:25:15,210
were too cruel.

738
00:25:15,480 --> 00:25:16,830
Later, Yan Jicai recanted

739
00:25:16,830 --> 00:25:18,230
his confession in court.

740
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:20,800
It was full of twists and turns.

741
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:23,360
There was immense pressure from all sides.

742
00:25:23,400 --> 00:25:24,460
You weren't there,

743
00:25:24,750 --> 00:25:27,240
so it's hard to understand
that kind of pressure.

744
00:25:27,240 --> 00:25:29,160
Everyone works very hard.

745
00:25:29,550 --> 00:25:30,370
You can't just

746
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,660
come here and hassle us

747
00:25:31,920 --> 00:25:33,790
because a criminal is being difficult.

748
00:25:33,790 --> 00:25:34,160
Lin,

749
00:25:35,440 --> 00:25:37,000
take this to Chen.

750
00:25:38,160 --> 00:25:38,440
Yes,

751
00:25:38,960 --> 00:25:39,960
you're right.

752
00:25:40,640 --> 00:25:41,750
He is

753
00:25:42,590 --> 00:25:43,450
just stubborn.

754
00:25:44,350 --> 00:25:45,500
He recanted with us too,

755
00:25:45,500 --> 00:25:46,700
saying it wasn't him.

756
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:49,000
He banged his head against the wall,

757
00:25:49,880 --> 00:25:51,510
getting blood everywhere.

758
00:25:53,270 --> 00:25:54,350
What we

759
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,100
really mean is,

760
00:25:56,110 --> 00:25:57,270
we want to get to

761
00:25:57,830 --> 00:25:59,400
the bottom of this case.

762
00:25:59,680 --> 00:26:01,210
You need to make him give up.

763
00:26:01,790 --> 00:26:04,030
So he stops banging his head all the time,

764
00:26:04,030 --> 00:26:05,350
or attempting suicide.

765
00:26:05,350 --> 00:26:06,030
If you think

766
00:26:06,030 --> 00:26:07,890
there's a problem with this case,

767
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:10,350
I can answer your questions.

768
00:26:11,400 --> 00:26:13,030
But to get a retrial,

769
00:26:14,200 --> 00:26:15,460
without new evidence,

770
00:26:16,070 --> 00:26:17,670
it's basically impossible.

771
00:26:27,070 --> 00:26:28,400
Basically impossible.

772
00:26:28,550 --> 00:26:29,790
We worked so hard all day

773
00:26:29,790 --> 00:26:31,030
just for him to say this?

774
00:26:31,030 --> 00:26:32,630
We still learned something.

775
00:26:32,680 --> 00:26:33,830
At least we know

776
00:26:34,200 --> 00:26:35,350
where they stand now.

777
00:26:35,350 --> 00:26:36,750
I don't think they'll take it seriously

778
00:26:36,750 --> 00:26:38,280
without official backing.

779
00:26:40,110 --> 00:26:40,640
Let's go.

780
00:26:46,720 --> 00:26:47,120
Hello?

781
00:26:48,070 --> 00:26:49,000
Prosecutor You.

782
00:26:51,110 --> 00:26:51,640
Guo,

783
00:26:52,350 --> 00:26:53,680
aren't you on vacation?

784
00:26:54,200 --> 00:26:55,460
Why did you go to Nanlu?

785
00:26:56,200 --> 00:26:57,070
This case,

786
00:26:57,790 --> 00:26:59,440
I really can't let it go.

787
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:01,640
Guo Dajie,

788
00:27:02,030 --> 00:27:03,200
do you have any sense

789
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:04,480
of organizational discipline?

790
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:05,410
Prosecutor You.

791
00:27:06,200 --> 00:27:08,160
I'm a bit obsessed now.

792
00:27:08,720 --> 00:27:10,750
This case is haunting me.

793
00:27:11,200 --> 00:27:12,790
My... my mental state

794
00:27:12,830 --> 00:27:14,550
is... a little off.

795
00:27:14,720 --> 00:27:15,250
You know?

796
00:27:15,440 --> 00:27:16,920
If you don't figure it out,

797
00:27:16,920 --> 00:27:17,960
I'll die

798
00:27:19,400 --> 00:27:20,880
with my eyes open.

799
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:22,170
Cut the crap.

800
00:27:22,920 --> 00:27:24,720
You seem perfectly normal to me.

801
00:27:25,070 --> 00:27:26,000
Prosecutor You.

802
00:27:26,110 --> 00:27:28,370
We've known each other for so many years.

803
00:27:28,440 --> 00:27:30,070
I've never...

804
00:27:30,240 --> 00:27:31,790
You've never asked me for anything.

805
00:27:31,790 --> 00:27:33,320
Is that what you want to say?

806
00:27:37,110 --> 00:27:38,830
That's what I call true buddies.

807
00:27:38,830 --> 00:27:41,160
I've never asked you for anything either.

808
00:27:41,310 --> 00:27:41,790
Now,

809
00:27:42,680 --> 00:27:43,610
I'm begging you,

810
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:46,270
stop causing trouble
for the procuratorate.

811
00:27:46,270 --> 00:27:47,600
Come back immediately.

812
00:27:48,310 --> 00:27:48,710
Hello?

813
00:27:50,200 --> 00:27:52,270
The line is crackling.

814
00:27:53,270 --> 00:27:54,680
I can't hear you clearly.

815
00:27:55,790 --> 00:27:57,050
Well, Prosecutor You,

816
00:27:57,480 --> 00:27:58,480
just listen to me.

817
00:27:58,880 --> 00:28:00,210
I'm not asking for much.

818
00:28:00,350 --> 00:28:01,350
Just have our procuratorate

819
00:28:01,350 --> 00:28:02,880
send a fax over here,

820
00:28:02,920 --> 00:28:03,850
requesting them

821
00:28:03,920 --> 00:28:05,110
to allow us to review

822
00:28:05,160 --> 00:28:07,160
all the case files from that year.

823
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:07,820
That's all.

824
00:28:08,240 --> 00:28:08,960
Us?

825
00:28:09,590 --> 00:28:11,050
Who else went besides you?

826
00:28:14,480 --> 00:28:14,880
I...

827
00:28:16,480 --> 00:28:17,030
Hello?

828
00:28:18,310 --> 00:28:19,680
This phone line is terrible.

829
00:28:19,680 --> 00:28:20,740
Can't hear a thing.

830
00:28:20,880 --> 00:28:21,590
Guo,

831
00:28:22,110 --> 00:28:23,310
this isn't like you.

832
00:28:23,960 --> 00:28:25,590
You're being so reckless.

833
00:28:26,070 --> 00:28:26,930
Think about it.

834
00:28:27,110 --> 00:28:29,350
What if we dig everything up
and find nothing wrong?

835
00:28:29,350 --> 00:28:29,920
How are we going to

836
00:28:29,920 --> 00:28:31,750
explain ourselves to our Nanlu comrades?

837
00:28:31,750 --> 00:28:32,750
I can hear you now.

838
00:28:33,350 --> 00:28:34,280
Prosecutor You.

839
00:28:34,480 --> 00:28:35,940
Statistically speaking,

840
00:28:36,590 --> 00:28:37,750
what do you think

841
00:28:37,750 --> 00:28:39,240
the odds are that there's never been

842
00:28:39,240 --> 00:28:40,640
a wrongful conviction?

843
00:28:41,400 --> 00:28:43,510
On my honor as a prosecutor,

844
00:28:43,510 --> 00:28:44,160
I guarantee you

845
00:28:44,160 --> 00:28:44,960
that this case

846
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,790
definitely has a problem!

847
00:28:47,200 --> 00:28:48,860
Since we've already started,

848
00:28:49,510 --> 00:28:51,680
I'm determined to get to the bottom

849
00:28:51,720 --> 00:28:52,680
of this case!

850
00:29:01,350 --> 00:29:02,200
Prosecutor You,

851
00:29:02,200 --> 00:29:03,480
are you still there?

852
00:29:04,590 --> 00:29:05,520
Prosecutor You.

853
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:07,240
Listen to me, Guo.

854
00:29:07,550 --> 00:29:08,750
This is the last time!

855
00:29:10,070 --> 00:29:10,800
How did it go?

856
00:29:11,550 --> 00:29:13,270
The fax will be here today.

857
00:29:14,110 --> 00:29:15,960
You're the best, Mentor.

858
00:29:16,440 --> 00:29:16,920
Lihui?

859
00:29:23,720 --> 00:29:24,580
Zheng Jianmin.

860
00:29:26,750 --> 00:29:27,680
It really is you.

861
00:30:03,920 --> 00:30:04,850
Don't be scared.

862
00:30:05,200 --> 00:30:05,800
It's okay.

863
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:19,920
Food.

864
00:30:21,110 --> 00:30:22,070
I want...

865
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:26,240
I want my mom.

866
00:30:33,510 --> 00:30:33,840
Here.

867
00:30:36,480 --> 00:30:37,680
Grandma is sleeping.

868
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:40,310
Food.

869
00:30:43,830 --> 00:30:44,760
Delicious food.

870
00:30:45,750 --> 00:30:46,880
Let me pour you some.

871
00:30:53,510 --> 00:30:54,480
Go on, eat.

872
00:31:06,440 --> 00:31:07,960
Good, good.

873
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:00,370
Why are you here?

874
00:32:02,200 --> 00:32:03,060
Came to see you.

875
00:32:06,310 --> 00:32:07,440
Murder!

876
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,880
Murder!

877
