964
00:34:54,110 --> 00:34:55,170
Now, Lihui, Lihui.

965
00:34:55,280 --> 00:34:56,150
Calm down, calm down.

966
00:34:56,150 --> 00:34:56,630
Wang.

967
00:34:57,110 --> 00:34:58,360
Come, sit down.

968
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,570
