It's not in the file.

1145
00:42:16,400 --> 00:42:18,660
No wonder you treated me to dinner today.

1146
00:42:20,760 --> 00:42:21,670
I'm kidding.

1147
00:42:22,440 --> 00:42:23,880
I'm not kidding.

1148
00:42:28,020 --> 00:42:28,800
It's likely the police

1149
00:42:28,800 --> 00:42:30,630
