1152
00:42:33,230 --> 00:42:34,030
But honestly,

1153
00:42:34,190 --> 00:42:35,590
just based on the DNA
found in the fingernails

1154
00:42:35,590 --> 00:42:36,920
not matching Yan Jicai,

1155
00:42:37,320 --> 00:42:39,550
it will hardly be enough
to overturn the verdict.

1156
00:42:39,550 --> 00:42:40,950
You are a prosecutor now.

1157
00:42:41,150 --> 00:42:42,610
Don't you see gaping holes

1158
00:42:42,630 --> 00:42:44,090
